NVIDIA Nsight Perf
Usage:
  nvidia-nsight-perf [OPTION...]

      --config arg              NVIDIA Nsight Perf config YAML path 
                                (default: "")
      --export-default-config-only arg
                                Export the default NVIDIA Nsight Perf 
                                config YAML to the specified path and exit; 
                                no service is started (default: "")
      --timeout-ms arg          Initialization timeout in milliseconds 
                                (default: 4294967295)
      --validate-config         Validate the config and exit; reports what 
                                each GpuPmCounters entry resolves to. No 
                                GPU required, no service started
      --chip arg                With --validate-config, also report whether 
                                the entry covering this chip schedules in 
                                one pass, e.g. --chip GB202. Needs the 
                                PerfWorks host library but no GPU (default: 
                                "")
      --global                  Run the service in global scope (Linux: 
                                always on for root; Windows: requires 
                                Administrator)
  -h, --help                    Print help

